  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **`EndpointId` loses its parameterless constructor, which made a new random id: `EndpointId.New()` makes one now.** System.Text.Json writes and reads an `EndpointId` as its `Guid` string, with the `EntityIdJsonConverter` of Compze.Abstractions, which `EndpointId` carries. Its constructor's parameter is named `value`, where it was `id`. Endpoint discovery's wire format is unchanged.\n- **Built against `TessageId.New()` of Compze.Tessaging.Abstractions, which replaces `TessageId`'s parameterless constructor:** the released version calls the constructor, which the new Compze.Tessaging.Abstractions no longer has, and would fail beside it with a `MissingMethodException`.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Abstractions 0.5.0-alpha (was 0.4.1-alpha), Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.12.0-internal (was 0.10.0-internal), Compze.Tessaging.Abstractions 0.7.0-alpha (was 0.6.0-alpha), Compze.Threading 0.14.0-alpha (was 0.13.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
